body:
I made a workaround:

``` php
clearstatcache( true );
file_put_contents( \Yii::getAlias( '@runtime/.need_clearstatcache' ), time() );
```

And in `web/index.php`:

``` php
// clearstatcache for other php threads
if (file_exists( $clearstatfile = dirname(__DIR__) . '/runtime/.need_clearstatcache' )
    && filemtime( $clearstatfile ) > ( time() - intval( ini_get( 'realpath_cache_ttl' ) ) )
) {
    clearstatcache( true );
}
```
